WEBVTT

00:16:59.781 --> 00:17:01.670
But if you're an optimistic penguin

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.466
who believes they can fly,

00:17:03.466 --> 00:17:06.129
but then adjusts a parachute to your back

00:17:06.129 --> 00:17:09.146
just in case things don't work out exactly as you had planned,

00:17:09.146 --> 00:17:11.009
you will soar like an eagle,

00:17:11.009 --> 00:17:14.058
even if you're just a penguin.

00:17:14.058 --> 00:17:15.820
Thank you.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:18.756
(Applause)